<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 65 0 R/T(Use file handling to save tournament results as readable text and as CSV, and to load them back. Use exception handling \(try, catch and classes derived from std::runtime_error\) to reject invalid scores and other bad input.)/E(Use file handling to save tournament results as readable text and as CSV, and to load them back. Use exception handling \(try, catch and classes derived from std::runtime_error\) to reject invalid scores and other bad input.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[14]>>
