<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 77 0 R/T(realistic system. Inheritance removed duplicated code between player types, polymorphism let the tournament treat every player the same way while still producing different scores and rewards, operator overloading made ranking and team totals read naturally, file handling saved the results for later use, and exception handling stopped bad scores from entering the rankings. The Valorant theme made the data realistic and the output easy to follow.)/E(realistic system. Inheritance removed duplicated code between player types, polymorphism let the tournament treat every player the same way while still producing different scores and rewards, operator overloading made ranking and team totals read naturally, file handling saved the results for later use, and exception handling stopped bad scores from entering the rankings. The Valorant theme made the data realistic and the output easy to follow.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[14]>>
