1281 0 obj
<</Title(The text file is meant to be read or printed. The CSV file keeps the player table in a form that opens directly in Excel or Google Sheets or can be read by another program; loadResults\(\) in the demo reads it back, checks that every row has seven fields, and reports 6 player rows.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1173 0 R>>
endobj

