<</Title(Each match produces three statistics per player: kills \(K\), deaths \(D\) and assists \(A\). The winner of a match is the player with the higher value of K + A - D. If both values are equal, player 1 is declared the winner. The points awarded then depend on the player type.)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1344 0 R/Next 1459 0 R>>
